   "text": "Beth planned Christmas week at the Grand Canyon's North Rim.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 3.666
  },
  {
   "text": "The highway there closes for winter, usually by December 1, and the gates stay locked until mid-May.",
   "start": 3.916,
   "end": 10.063
  },
  {
   "text": "The rule: in winter, plan the South Rim.",
   "start": 10.363,
   "end": 12.737
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your Grand Canyon trip.",
   "start": 13.037,
   "end": 15.098
